  "content": "<h1>更多附魔信息</h1><p>为JEI添加附魔信息\n<img src=\"https://github.com/SettingDust/MoreEnchantmentInfo/raw/refs/heads/main/img.png\" alt=\"img.png\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/SettingDust/MoreEnchantmentInfo/raw/refs/heads/main/img_1.png\" alt=\"img_1.png\"></p><h2>功能特点</h2><ul>\n<li>支持附魔描述</li>\n<li>附魔属性，例如可交易、可探索、类别、稀有度等</li>\n<li>适用的物品</li>\n<li>附魔冲突</li>\n</ul><h2>致谢</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fjowys-8x8-classic_style_items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/jowys-8x8-classic_style_items</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funfaithful-8x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/unfaithful-8x</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftiny-pixels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/tiny-pixels</a></li>\n</ul>",
